# NBA ingestion: real stats.nba.com snapshots, pbpstats working copies, derived
# stint rows, and audit manifests (DATA_SOURCES.md 1 / 5.1 -- no Bronze or
# row-level NBA-derived data in Git). `courtgraph ingest` also drops a
# `.gitignore` (`*`) into whatever --out-dir it is given, so an arbitrary output
# directory is self-protecting; these entries are defense in depth.
# Hand-authored fixtures under tests/ are committed and not matched here.
data/nba_snapshots/
courtgraph_ingest/
courtgraph-ingest-work-*/
**/stints.jsonl
**/quarantine.jsonl
ingest_out/

